stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Checking the geohash and command options
  s1: Command rejected before dispatch
  s2: Dispatching to daemon
  s3: Privacy warning shown, dispatching
  s4: Daemon request failed
  s5: Daemon accepted the request
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: require force or reject invalid options
  s0 --> s2: accept the command
  s0 --> s3: accept the command
  s2 --> s4: report daemon failure
  s2 --> s5: return daemon success
  s3 --> s4: report daemon failure
  s3 --> s5: return daemon success
